@startuml
title User Profile Management
actor User
participant UserProfile.vue
participant users.ts
participant users.py
participant user_service.py
database MySQL

User -> UserProfile.vue: Visit /profile
activate UserProfile.vue
UserProfile.vue -> UserProfile.vue: Load user data from authStore
UserProfile.vue --> User: Display profile form

User -> UserProfile.vue: Edit profile fields
User -> UserProfile.vue: Click Save
UserProfile.vue -> UserProfile.vue: Validate form data
UserProfile.vue -> users.ts: updateUserProfile(data)
activate users.ts
users.ts -> users.py: PATCH /users/profile
activate users.py
users.py -> users.py: Verify JWT token
users.py -> user_service.py: update_user_profile()
activate user_service.py
user_service.py -> MySQL: UPDATE users SET ...
MySQL --> user_service.py: updated user
user_service.py --> users.py: user
deactivate user_service.py
users.py --> users.ts: 200 OK
deactivate users.py
users.ts --> UserProfile.vue: success
deactivate users.ts

UserProfile.vue -> UserProfile.vue: Update authStore
UserProfile.vue --> User: Show success message
deactivate UserProfile.vue
@enduml